== Verified primary gallery source ==
[https://web.archive.org/web/20071218115237id_/http://www.swccgpc.com/cards/anewhope/ls/hethkik.gif Original archived PC gallery GIF], captured 18 December 2007 at 11:52:37 UTC. Actual source title is Het Nkik; the historical URL filename is hethkik.gif. The unchanged GIF SHA-256 is <code style="overflow-wrap:anywhere;white-space:normal">00aa47809cfde2cba8b23ae42f398f136b36b7937fe68e6573f3994d1aae793e</code>; its SHA-1 matches the exact CDX digest. This establishes a known-by bound, not an original first-publication day. Native title, unique dot, destiny 3, lore, Warrior icon, power 1, ability 2, asterisk deploy and forfeit 1 are visible. No E mark is printed on this older full face. Rarity is catalogue-derived, landspeed is rule-derived and persona/traits follow the source-qualified printed name/lore. No new executable identifier is assigned.

The November 1998 Glossary prints the corrected wording on page 68, while its page 2 frontmatter distinguishes clarified wording from the seventeen gray entries explicitly marked Errata. This entry is not so marked. The gallery, 2017 slip and later full faces retain the same corrected wording; no additional gameplay change is asserted from their layouts. The original physical wording remains separately documented. Jawa deployment costs and the undefined asterisk are explained on Glossary page 77; the current Advanced Rulebook repeats the card wording on page 115 and the Jawa clarification on page 147.

The archive capture, sheet edition and repository imports identify known source occurrences, not original first-publication days. The original first-publication order of potentially reused sheet and full images is not independently established.